{"parentUuid":"1f19dad1-aaa0-47ee-b540-e3190368909b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"2c07e252-7916-47b4-a152-a8b08381b0dc","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about OBS (Open Broadcaster Software) recording issues - their recorded footage looks overexposed. They want to know:\n1. Why it's happening\n2. How to fix it at the source\n3. How to color correct in post-production\n\nThis is not a software engineering task related to the game project. It's a general streaming/recording question about OBS settings and video post-processing.\n\nLet me give them a concise, helpful answer.","signature":"2c07e252-7916-47b4-a152-a8b08381b0dc"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":35625,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":670,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"b8e89407-ea3f-4806-a185-466e1e938b95","timestamp":"2026-05-19T15:20:34.643Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\13751","sessionId":"7ad04b1c-b250-4929-92e2-5d7da59611e9","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"b8e89407-ea3f-4806-a185-466e1e938b95","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"2c07e252-7916-47b4-a152-a8b08381b0dc","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## OBS 录制过曝的原因和解决\n\n### 常见原因\n\n1. **HDR 录制到 SDR** — 这是最常见的原因。显示器是 HDR，OBS 录制 HDR 画面但播放器/剪辑软件按 SDR 解码，就会过曝。\n2. **色彩范围不匹配** — OBS 输出「完整范围(0-255)」，但播放器按「视频范围(16-235)」解码。\n3. **显卡驱动层面的画面增强** — NVIDIA 控制面板里的数字振动、对比度增强等覆盖到 OBS 捕获上。\n4. **OBS 颜色设置里的色域/色彩空间不对** — 比如输出了 Rec.2100(PQ) 但预期是 Rec.709。\n\n### 解决方法（按优先级）\n\n**方法 1 — 检查 HDR（大概率是它）：**\n- OBS → 设置 → 高级 → 视频 → 颜色格式：选 `NV12(8-bit)`，色彩空间 `Rec.709`，范围 `Partial`\n- Windows 显示设置 → HDR：**关掉**，或者开启后去 OBS 调对应的 HDR 色彩空间\n\n**方法 2 — 色彩范围：**\n- OBS → 设置 → 高级 → 视频 → YUV 色彩范围：选 **Partial（视频范围）**，不是 Full\n- 播放器/剪辑软件也设成对应范围\n\n**方法 3 — 显卡设置：**\n- NVIDIA 控制面板 → 调整视频颜色设置 → 选「通过视频播放器设置」而非「通过 NVIDIA 设置」\n- 或者在「调整桌面颜色设置」里还原默认值\n\n**方法 4 — 添加色彩校正滤镜：**\n- OBS 视频捕获设备上右键 → 滤镜 → 添加「色彩校正」\n- 降低 Gamma（0.85 左右）或对比度试一下\n\n### 后期调色补救\n\n如果素材已经过曝了：\n\n- **DaVinci Resolve**（免费）：在 Color 页面拉低 Gain（降低高亮），微调 Gamma，再加一点 Contrast。HDR 素材需要先做色彩空间转换（Color Space Transform 节点：Rec.2100 → Rec.709）。\n- **Premiere Pro**：用 Lumetri 颜色面板，降低**曝光**和**高光**，拉高一点**阴影**恢复细节。\n- **过曝超过阈值（高光裁切）就救不回来了**，所以优先从源头解决。\n\n---\n\n**最快的诊断：看一眼 OBS 高级设置的色彩空间是不是 Rec.2100(PQ) — 如果是，改回 Rec.709 大概率秒修。**"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":35625,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":670,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"8ff81ca3-e591-4337-942d-eb9012cc9aa4","timestamp":"2026-05-19T15:20:55.457Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\13751","sessionId":"7ad04b1c-b250-4929-92e2-5d7da59611e9","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
