{"parentUuid":"40632e85-10ea-4f2e-bbe5-a1a53b562493","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"7e150689-d540-45ad-a155-96cad502af00","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying they only have CapCut (剪映) for video editing, not DaVinci Resolve or Premiere Pro. They want to know how to fix overexposed OBS footage in CapCut specifically.\n\nLet me give them targeted advice for CapCut.","signature":"7e150689-d540-45ad-a155-96cad502af00"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":621,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":35584,"output_tokens":552,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"aaac01aa-e3b7-4ebc-a2a4-8d270f06c84f","timestamp":"2026-05-19T15:21:49.076Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\13751","sessionId":"7ad04b1c-b250-4929-92e2-5d7da59611e9","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"aaac01aa-e3b7-4ebc-a2a4-8d270f06c84f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"7e150689-d540-45ad-a155-96cad502af00","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## 剪映后期调色补救\n\n### 素材过曝分类\n\n先确认素材类型，处理方式不同：\n\n| 素材类型 | 特征 | 能救吗 |\n|----------|------|--------|\n| HDR 错误映射 | 整体泛白、像蒙了一层雾 | **可完全救回** |\n| 真正过曝 | 亮部纯白无细节（RGB 255,255,255） | 只能降亮度，细节回不来 |\n| 范围不匹配 | 暗部不够黑、亮部刺眼 | **可完全救回** |\n\n### 剪映操作\n\n**如果是 HDR→SDR / 范围不匹配（调整基础）：**\n\n1. 导入素材到时间线\n2. 右侧面板 → **调节** → 分别调：\n   - **对比度**：+15~25（拉开层次）\n   - **饱和度**：-5~10（HDR 转过来通常饱和过高）\n   - **高光**：-30~50（压亮部）\n   - **阴影**：+10~15（提暗部细节）\n   - **光感**：-10~20（剪映特有参数，整体柔和度）\n3. 如果还是泛白 → **褪色**拉 +5~10 试试\n\n**如果是真正过曝（调色挽救）：**\n\n1. 调节面板：\n   - **曝光**：-0.3~-1.0\n   - **高光**：拉到最低试试\n   - **白色**：-10~20\n   - **亮度**：-5~15\n2. 曲线工具（如果有）：把右上角锚点往下拖\n3. 可选：加一个「胶片」或「复古」LUT（滤镜里找），有时能掩盖过曝\n\n**剪映的 LUT 方案：**\n\n- 滤镜 → 搜索「胶片」「电影」类滤镜，很多会压高光\n- 叠加后把滤镜强度调到 30-50%，别全量\n\n### 根源上\n\n剪映能救的有限，真正过曝裁切掉的高光信息是回不来的。**建议还是先把 OBS 的色彩空间从 Rec.2100 改回 Rec.709 再录**，这样剪映里几乎不用调色。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":621,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":35584,"output_tokens":552,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"d6fb1196-4723-465e-ab32-696321d8dd1e","timestamp":"2026-05-19T15:22:07.547Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\13751","sessionId":"7ad04b1c-b250-4929-92e2-5d7da59611e9","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
