{"parentUuid":"03e0fb53-d740-4aa6-b947-5ad19ece6711","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"task_reminder","content":[],"itemCount":0},"type":"attachment","uuid":"3bae0999-7e69-4999-b04e-f99a64f69016","timestamp":"2026-05-19T15:23:48.893Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\13751","sessionId":"7ad04b1c-b250-4929-92e2-5d7da59611e9","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"3bae0999-7e69-4999-b04e-f99a64f69016","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"1f866b48-2916-43a0-9bc8-2f177818aa83","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze the OBS configuration:\n\n**Video Settings (basic.ini):**\n- Resolution: 1920x1080, Output: 1920x1080\n- FPS: 60\n- Color Format: NV12 ✅ (correct)\n- Color Space: 709 ✅ (correct)\n- Color Range: Partial ✅ (correct)\n- SDR White Level: 300\n- HDR Nominal Peak Level: 1000\n\nThe main settings look correct - ColorSpace 709 with Partial range should NOT cause overexposure.\n\n**Scene Configuration:**\n- Has \"显示器采集\" (monitor capture) and \"游戏采集\" (game capture) sources\n- On the \"游戏采集\" source, there are 5 filters:\n  1. 亮度键 (Luma Key) - enabled\n  2. 色值 (Color Key) - brightness: 0.0234, contrast: 0.0, gamma: 0.0\n  3. 色度键 (Chroma Key) - brightness: 0.0042, contrast: 0.08\n  4. 色彩校正 (Color Correction) - **gamma: -0.21**, contrast: 0.08, brightness: -0.0029, saturation: 0.11\n  5. 锐化 (Sharpness) - 0.04\n\n**Key findings:**\n\n1. **色彩空间设置本身正确** — NV12 + Rec.709 + Partial，这个不会导致过曝。\n\n2. **但是「游戏采集」上叠了多个滤镜**，尤其是：\n   - **亮度键 + 色值 + 色度键** — 三个键控滤镜同时启用且有微小的 brightness/contrast 偏移\n   - **色彩校正滤镜**：gamma 拉到 -0.21（负 gamma = 提亮中间调），saturation +0.11\n\n3. **显示器分辨率问题**：显示器采集源的 `scale_ref` 是 1280x960（说明显示器可能是 1280x960 或更低分辨率），然后缩放到 1920x1080 画布。但游戏采集是原生 1920x1080。\n\n**最可能的原因：**\n\n问题不在色彩空间（那个是对的），而在于：\n1. **色彩校正滤镜**：Gamma -0.21 会明显提亮画面，让中间调往上飘，视觉上就是\"过曝\"\n2. **亮度键 + 色值 + 色度键同时开启**：这三个滤镜叠加可能造成意外的亮度提升\n3. **SdrWhiteLevel=300**：这个值代表 SDR 白电平是 300 nits，如果你的显示器实际更亮，OBS 可能会按这个值做映射\n\n**还有一个我没看到的问题**：OBS 版本号是 `536936450`，需要查一下这个是什么版本。\n\n等等，让我再注意一下 - OBS 的场景里同时有「显示器采集」和「游戏采集」两个源叠在一起！如果两个都可见（visible: true），而且显示器采集设置了 bounds 缩放，这可能也会造成画面叠加变亮。\n\n实际上，看 scene items：\n- 显示器采集 visible: true\n- 游戏采集 visible: true\n\n它们叠在一起！但游戏采集在显示器采集上面（id 3 vs id 2），而且游戏采集是 1920x1080 全画布，所以正常应该只看到游戏采集。但如果游戏采集没有捕获到画面（比如游戏没开），就会透到下面的显示器采集。\n\n不过这不太可能是过曝原因。\n\n**核心诊断结论：**\n\nOBS 的色彩空间设置（NV12 + Rec.709 + Partial）是正确的，不会导致你之前担心的 HDR→SDR 过曝。\n\n问题出在 **「游戏采集」源上的滤镜堆叠**：\n- 色彩校正的 Gamma -0.21 是最主要的过曝元凶\n- 三个键控滤镜同时开启也有微小贡献\n\n现在让我把这些发现清楚地告诉用户。","signature":"1f866b48-2916-43a0-9bc8-2f177818aa83"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6142,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":38912,"output_tokens":1218,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"eddc7d16-aa96-4b44-a313-795d6439beed","timestamp":"2026-05-19T15:24:17.465Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\13751","sessionId":"7ad04b1c-b250-4929-92e2-5d7da59611e9","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"eddc7d16-aa96-4b44-a313-795d6439beed","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"1f866b48-2916-43a0-9bc8-2f177818aa83","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## 诊断结果\n\n你的 OBS 色彩空间设置是 **正确的** — NV12 + Rec.709 + Partial，不会导致 HDR→SDR 过曝。问题出在别处。\n\n### 找到三个问题\n\n**问题 1（主要元凶）— 色彩校正滤镜的 Gamma：**\n\n你的「游戏采集」源上挂了一个「色彩校正」滤镜，**Gamma 被拉到了 -0.21**。负 Gamma = 大幅提亮中间调，画面直接泛白过曝。\n\n```\n滤镜 → 色彩校正 → Gamma: -0.21  ← 这个就是罪魁祸首\n                → 饱和度: +0.11  ← 也会让画面更刺眼\n```\n\n**问题 2 — 三个键控滤镜同时开启：**\n\n游戏采集上同时启用了亮度键 + 色值 + 色度键，虽然各自偏移很小，但叠加后有累积效应。\n\n**问题 3 — 场景有两个源叠在一起：**\n\n你的「CS」场景里同时放了「显示器采集」和「游戏采集」，两个都是 `visible: true`。如果游戏没捕获到画面，下面的显示器采集会透上来，两个源叠加可能意外增亮。\n\n### 建议操作\n\n**立刻见效的（在 OBS 里操作）：**\n\n1. 右键「游戏采集」→ 滤镜 → 把「色彩校正」的 **Gamma 改回 0**，饱和度也改回 0\n2. 把那三个键控滤镜（亮度键/色值/色度键）**关掉**，除非你明确需要绿幕抠图\n3. 场景里把不用的「显示器采集」源隐藏掉（点眼睛图标），只留游戏采集\n\n改完录一段看看，大概率秒修。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6142,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":38912,"output_tokens":1218,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"fcae6c1b-59b1-47b6-9976-94a60e58f9e6","timestamp":"2026-05-19T15:24:29.371Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\13751","sessionId":"7ad04b1c-b250-4929-92e2-5d7da59611e9","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
