{"parentUuid":"99afa6ed-cfb7-4dea-bdf1-5ac17f4129fb","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"away_summary","content":"你在排查 OBS 录屏过曝。我们已经定位到问题：你「游戏采集」源上的色彩校正滤镜 Gamma 被设为 -0.21，这是过曝元凶。下一步：把 Gamma 改回 0，关掉那三个键控滤镜，再录一段验证。 (disable recaps in /config)","timestamp":"2026-05-19T15:27:58.681Z","uuid":"287b9224-75ef-4441-9776-18a7bbad878f","isMeta":false,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\13751","sessionId":"7ad04b1c-b250-4929-92e2-5d7da59611e9","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
