{"parentUuid":"45e345a2-6949-4b0a-bb7f-35729698e312","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"1c108a32-58c9-408b-a61d-fad641580a86","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, interesting findings:\n\n1. **Monitor: ASUS TUF Gaming VG258QM** — 24.5\" TN panel, 1920x1080, 280Hz, HDR support. This monitor has HDR capability.\n2. **DisplayTransferCharacteristic: 120** = Gamma 2.2 (sRGB standard), which is normal.\n3. **GPU: AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT** — latest AMD GPU with latest drivers (May 2026).\n4. **Windows HDR registry key**: Not found in the standard location.\n5. **OBS settings**: NV12 + Rec.709 + Partial — correct for SDR.\n\nNow, the critical symptom: \"click mouse → normal for 1 second → white again\". This is very specific.\n\nThe monitor VG258QM has HDR support. Even if Windows HDR toggle is \"off\", there could be:\n- The monitor's own HDR mode enabled in OSD\n- AMD driver-level \"Vari-Bright\" or color enhancement\n- Windows \"Auto HDR\" for games\n- The game itself rendering in HDR/scRGB mode\n- AMD's \"Display Color Enhancement\" in Adrenalin\n\nLet me check:\n- Windows Auto HDR settings (separate from main HDR toggle)\n- AMD Adrenalin settings files in AppData\n- Monitor OSD settings (can't check directly, but can inform user)\n\nAlso, now the key new fact: the monitor IS HDR-capable. Even with Windows HDR toggle off, the monitor might be in HDR mode at the display level, or there might be an AMD driver setting converting SDR to HDR on output.\n\nWait, I want to check something specific. The `VideoOutputTechnology: 10` = DisplayPort. And the VG258QM is a 280Hz monitor. At such high refresh rates with DP, there could be color depth/format negotiation issues.\n\nLet me look at:\n1. AMD Adrenalin display color settings\n2. Windows Color Management settings\n3. Whether there's an AMD \"Custom Color\" or \"Display Color Enhancement\" enabled\n\nLet me also check if there are AMD CN (Adrenalin) profiles that modify color.","signature":"1c108a32-58c9-408b-a61d-fad641580a86"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4260,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":50688,"output_tokens":1034,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"4bdb5ce9-8ea1-4e93-b6f7-c7863271009d","timestamp":"2026-05-19T15:55:50.826Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\13751","sessionId":"7ad04b1c-b250-4929-92e2-5d7da59611e9","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
